{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Huuu~&quot; is a 30-minute healing experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the days of recovery from illness, the protagonist begins to communicate with the wind. Guided by the breeze, they embark on a journey through the memories of the four seasons\u2014healing old wounds and awakening the courage to reconcile with themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending natural aesthetics with adventure and puzzle-solving, the game introduces a unique form of natural interaction: <i>breathing</i>. Players take on the role of a breeze in <i>Hoo~</i>, accompanying and aiding the protagonist on their journey. The wind has shape and emotion\u2014every breath resonates with the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players control the character\u2019s actions and environmental changes through the intensity and rhythm of their breath. Breathing directly influences the world\u2019s dynamics: a gentle, long breath sets feathers dancing through the air; a steady, short puff pushes the character forward; and a warm exhale can awaken slumbering plants and spirits.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718230?t=1757680427","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718230/ccb0b8e317ebeff2126c94a0baa7f5bd4cb6a62f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757680427","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718230/3c30bc84caeba7942a93bc49da1c02d076a83916/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757680427","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718230/3c30bc84caeba7942a93bc49da1c02d076a83916/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757680427","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed In